.MARINE...
(Today through Saturday)
Issued at 423 AM PDT Mon Aug 24 2026

Gentle northwest breezes persist today into Tuesday with slight
to moderate wind driven seas. Smoke from the Timber Fire along the
Big Sur coast may limit visibility down as low as two miles at
times. North-northwest winds begin to increase by the middle of
the week, along with an increasing long period southerly swell by
the end of the week into next weekend.

